            <history xml:id="history_287N2016A">
               <p xml:id="idm116">The printed edition which appeared in 1859 consists of two minuets with a prefatory introduction; the introduction, however, seems to be missing in Hartmann's manuscript. This suggests that the two minuets were originally conceived as independent movements which were subsequently brought together for this work.</p>
            </history>
